       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That's twice the usual maximum for adults of 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision. A single 1,600 mg dose is also double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg. At this level the risks of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up substantially.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1,600 mg total per day**, divided into smaller doses\n\nIf you do want 1,600 mg four times daily, please confirm that. I'd also want you to add a note with the clinical rationale. Once you tell me the dose and frequency, I'll enter it right away."
